<title>HUNGARY: Hungary one-month T-bill yield drops to 22.84 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary one-month T-bill yield drops to 22.84 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of Hungary's one-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 22.84 percent, down from 22.95 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Tuesday  HTBM.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	  940.03  million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated		940.03 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    22.84 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     98.2781 pct</p>
</text>
